# Two libraries export `Log`, and naming both bare is a clash (SPC-06). This
# was already refused before renaming existed and stays refused: the way out
# is `as` or a module alias (see effect_rename), never a silent pick. A rename
# that keeps a name's case class is also enforced -- see the grammar corpus.
use loga.{Log}
use logb.{Log}

